## Note on medical content

The MIT licence above covers the software: the plugins, the tools, the sleep
diary arithmetic, the CBT-I plan logic, the user interface, and the written
prose of this project.

It does not, and cannot, cover third-party medical documents. This package does
not redistribute them. Drug entries state clinical facts in this project's own
wording and link to their sources; anything quoted from a document is fetched at
runtime and returned to the user together with its source URL, rather than being
copied into this repository.

This software is not a medical device and does not provide diagnosis or
treatment. See the "Medical safety boundaries" section of README.md.
